INSERT INTO `tour_faqs` VALUES (1,150,'Is this a private tour and who is it suitable for?','Yes, this is a 100% private customized day tour with an exclusive air-conditioned vehicle and chauffeur. It is ideal for international travelers, couples, families, and history enthusiasts.',0,'published','2026-09-26 07:03:29','2026-09-26 07:03:29'),(2,150,'How long is the Mahabalipuram Day Tour and which places are covered?','The tour duration is approximately 8–10 hours. Key covered attractions include the UNESCO World Heritage Shore Temple, Arjuna\'s Penance, Krishna\'s Butter Ball, Pancha Rathas (Five Rathas), Covelong Beach, and ISKCON Temple.',1,'published','2026-09-26 07:03:29','2026-09-26 07:03:29'),(3,150,'What is included in the Mahabalipuram Day Tour package?','The package includes private AC cab transportation, chauffeur allowances, fuel, toll gate charges, and vehicle parking. Entrance tickets, guide fees, and meal arrangements can be chosen on-demand.',2,'published','2026-09-26 07:03:29','2026-09-26 07:03:29'),(22,169,'Do I need to know how to swim to join the surfing lessons?','Whether you know how to swim or not, we will guide you so that you can surf independently with no fear. Just like a pro surfer.',1,'published','2026-11-11 07:50:52','2026-11-11 07:50:52'),(23,169,'How are the surfing lessons structured?','Surfing lessons include a theatrical lesson for a half hour (30 minutes on equipment, handling, safety) followed by a practical session for one hour in the ocean.',2,'published','2026-11-11 07:50:52','2026-11-11 07:50:52'),(24,169,'What do you learn as a beginner?','For beginners, you learn: Equipment and safety instructions, How to handle the board in the water, How to stand up on a board, and how to Surf your first waves close to the beach.',3,'published','2026-11-11 07:50:52','2026-11-11 07:50:52'),(25,169,'What do you learn as an intermediator?','For intermediators, you learn: Refresher on basics, equipment and safety, How to paddle out behind the breaking waves, and How to take green waves on your own.',4,'published','2026-11-11 07:50:52','2026-11-11 07:50:52'),(26,169,'What are the prices and what do they include?','Prices for beginners start from 5000 INR. Prices for intermediators are 6000 INR. Prices include: 1. Transport, 2. Surfing theory and practical lessons, 3. Guide.',5,'published','2026-11-11 07:50:52','2026-11-11 07:50:52'),(27,169,'What are the opening times and contact details?','Opening Times: Every Day from 8 AM to 6 PM. Contact: E-Mail: welcome@yourbestdayinindia.com | Phone and WhatsApp: +91 9840291110.',6,'published','2026-11-11 07:50:52','2026-11-11 07:50:52'),(34,170,'What does Nadi mean and what is Nadi Astrology?','Nadi, in the ancient language of Tamil, means “in search of”. Because an individual goes in search of the predictions made for them, to find purpose and direction, the entire system of the Maharishis’ insights and predictions eventually came to be called by this name, Nadi Astrology.',1,'published','2026-11-12 05:06:25','2026-11-12 05:06:25'),(35,170,'How were the Palm Leaves prepared and preserved?','Three thousand years ago, personal information about you was dictated by the Maharishis to their disciples and handwritten on special Palm Leaves, also called Nadis. These Palm Leaves were preserved for all this time, for you to access their contents when you need it most.',2,'published','2026-11-12 05:06:25','2026-11-12 05:06:25'),(36,170,'What are the procedures for palm leaf reading?','1. Searching for bundle(s): we use your thumb impression and country of birth to search for candidate bundles. 2. Matching: moderated verification to identify your one personal leaf. 3. Reading: the reading lets you know about your life and future milestones.',3,'published','2026-11-12 05:06:25','2026-11-12 05:06:25'),(37,170,'What are the opening times?','Opening Times: Every Day from 10 AM to 6 PM.',4,'published','2026-11-12 05:06:25','2026-11-12 05:06:25'),(38,170,'What are the prices and what is included?','Prices for palm leaf horoscope per person: 7000 INR. Price includes: 1. Translator, 2. Transportation.',5,'published','2026-11-12 05:06:25','2026-11-12 05:06:25'),(39,170,'How do I contact or schedule an appointment?','Contact: E-Mail: welcome@yourbestdayinindia.com | Phone and WhatsApp: +91 9840291110.',6,'published','2026-11-12 05:06:25','2026-11-12 05:06:25');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `tour_faqs` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;

