'2026-11-11 07:50:52'),(26,170,'⏰','Open Every Day from 10 AM to 6 PM','Daily appointments available with direct organizer WhatsApp and email assistance.',3,'active','2026-11-11 07:50:52','2026-11-11 07:50:52');
